    "intro_narrative": "You awaken in the heart of a subterranean steam-powered facility, the air thick with the smell of coal smoke and the rhythmic chugging of giant pistons. The heavy iron doors behind you have sealed shut with a deafening clang, locking you inside the main boiler control room. Before you lies a sprawling network of brass pipes, ticking difference engines, and complex pneumatic contraptions left behind by a brilliant but mad inventor. Your only hope of escape is to decipher the mechanical logic of this grand engine. You must trace the invisible flow of data through the intricate cogs, valves, and ciphers to activate the final pressure release mechanism. The pressure gauges are steadily climbing toward the red zone. Time is ticking, and every gear matters if you want to make it out alive.",
    "narrative_style": "steampunk"
  },
